#
# shadow_fan.obj - Ceiling fan
#
# Geometry:   a hub, a closed cylinder of radius 1 and height 0.5 on the
#             y axis, and four blades, flat boxes 6 long, 1 wide and 0.05
#             thick, reaching out along x and z to about 7 from the axis.
#             Each piece is closed and convex; together they are not.
# Components: 64 vertices, 90 UV coordinates, all within the first texel,
#             since the fan is untextured, 64 vertex normals, each averaged
#             over the faces meeting at it, so the edges shade smoothly,
#             and 108 triangular faces.
# Used by:    shadow3 and shadow4, a plain grey lit and Gouraud shaded.
#
o shadow_fan
